# The meeting site receives the two fields in antiphase and they cancel there: it never fires, and its neighbours are the last to do so.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Collision of two pulses of opposite phase
sites 15
path 1 15 kappa=0.06
kick 1 amplitude=2
kick 15 amplitude=2 phase=180
run 1200
expect total 14
expect last 116.04245 0.003
expect count 1 1
expect arrival 1 12.96038 0.003
expect peak 1 58.059000 2e-4
expect count 3 1
expect arrival 3 48.19817 0.003
expect peak 3 56.712157 2e-4
